{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/ee1a811528bcb5ee5acadfdb0584a7ac.avif?t=1755834422\" width=800 height=889 /></span><br><br><strong>Some memories are so precious that the heart hides them, even from ourselves. </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/e65701e991d3c6dc9cdbf07ab49efbda.avif?t=1755834422\" width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>When Kaito encounters four girls at his school, the energetic Hikari, the gentle Aya, the confident Kaori, and the mysterious Mio, he experiences an inexplicable sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu. Their faces feel familiar, their voices echo in his mind, but he can't remember ever meeting them before. <br><br>Explore multiple story paths where your choices shape Kaito\u2019s bonds with each character, leading to unique endings that reveal hidden truths. Dive into a heartfelt narrative about memory, friendship, and the ties that bind us. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/62e9c9022a7524f69c870a6d3af21b97.avif?t=1755834422\" width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RE:Call is a single-player visual novel with beautiful anime-inspired artwork and a deeply emotional story. Experience a touching journey that invites you to remember what was meant to be forgotten. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Memories Awaken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855000/14ece9ab4cab47da095be55dff341a6660b63e19.jpg"},{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855000/18752dfb54df50f930be2a56634f3dbc2b